Frame dumps and frame statistics for librw's OpenGL 3 backend, matching the wgpu
renderer's (Phase 2 design, section 9). Inert unless REVC_FRAME_DUMP_DIR or
REVC_FRAME_STATS is set. Applied inside vendor/librw by reVC Builder.

